        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Satin Stainless Steel Floor Door Stop</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSatin stainless steel floor door stop with black bumper ring. Very easy to install. Just unscrew door stops top then screw directly to a wood surface or to the included floor anchor. Made of 304 stainless steel.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe floor mounted door stop is packaged with #10 x 1-1/4\" screw and plastic floor anchor.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FDS731-630_size.gif?v=1704354744\" width=\"300\" height=\"160\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Satin Stainless Steel Floor Door Stop\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the FDS731-630 Door Stop:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 1-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Height to Rubber Bumper: 1-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-3/16</li>\r\n<li>Black Bumper: 1/4\" Thick</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Satin Stainless Steel</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>** Clearance Priced,  limited quantities available. \r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\nOnly (102)  Left.\r\n</p>\r\n<!-- <p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>**Sold Out, see available <a href=\"/collections/stops-bumpers\">Door Stops</a></b>. \r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n\r\n</p> -->",
